---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="About" page="about">
<main>
<section class="wrap hero"><h1>More than what you wear.</h1><p>Clothing for people who want to look good, feel comfortable and express who they are.</p></section>
<section class="wrap sec" style="padding-top:0"><div class="two"><div><h2>Our story</h2></div><div><p style="font-size:20px;font-weight:700">Everyday clothing shouldn't have to trade comfort for style.</p><p class="mut" style="margin-top:16px">What started as making pieces we'd actually wear grew into a brand built on quality, confidence and individuality. Every design starts with one question: would we reach for this on a regular Tuesday? If not, it doesn't leave the studio.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="wrap sec" style="padding-top:0"><h2 style="margin-bottom:24px">What we stand for</h2><div class="two">
<div class="box"><h3>Quality</h3><p class="mut">Premium materials and construction designed to last.</p></div><div class="box dk"><h3>Comfort</h3><p>Clothing that feels as good as it looks.</p></div><div class="box"><h3>Individuality</h3><p class="mut">Wear what represents you. Don't dress to fit in.</p></div><div class="box dk"><h3>Confidence</h3><p>Every piece helps you feel at ease in your own style.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="wrap sec" style="padding-top:0"><h2 style="margin-bottom:24px">Made with purpose</h2><div class="two">
<div class="box"><h3>Premium cotton</h3><p class="mut">Soft, breathable and shape-holding wash after wash.</p></div><div class="box"><h3>Quality blends</h3><p class="mut">Used where they work better, for stretch and recovery.</p></div><div class="box"><h3>Comfortable fits</h3><p class="mut">Relaxed silhouettes designed around real bodies.</p></div><div class="box"><h3>Durable construction</h3><p class="mut">Reinforced stitching and clean seams that outlast the season.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="band"><div class="wrap sec"><h2>Find your next favourite piece.</h2><p>Clothing made for your everyday.</p><a class="btn" href="/">Shop the collection</a></div></section></main>
</Layout>
